Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.21,0:00:06.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, see, the way it's set\Nnow, the gyro's too sensitive.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.95,0:00:09.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you want to prioritize\Nthe visual tracking,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.59,0:00:12.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you gotta give yourself a little\Nmore room in these parameters.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.01,0:00:16.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, but won't it lag like crazy\Nif she makes any sudden moves?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.51,0:00:18.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess you'll just have to trust that the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.57,0:00:21.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,learning program and the\Noptimizer can deal with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.93,0:00:23.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How much longer, guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.73,0:00:25.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our lunch break's almost over!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.75,0:00:29.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's just save this as the\Ndefault setting and hope it works.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.37,0:00:31.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, uh, Yuki, can you hear okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.17,0:00:34.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yep, I hear you loud and clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.59,0:00:35.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good, all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.11,0:00:38.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm firing up the lens now,\Nso it might get bright.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.65,0:00:41.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let me know when you can see perfect.\NAnd I'll lock that setting in.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.53,0:00:42.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fire away!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.69,0:00:46.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold it!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.27,0:00:48.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, you're ready to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.35,0:00:53.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Last thing, I installed stabilizers,\Nbut they're kind of janky.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.17,0:00:54.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Try not to make any sudden moves, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.99,0:00:56.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, thanks, Kirito!
