Dialogue: 1,0:02:27.02,0:02:31.02,Title,,0,0,0,,{\blur3\bord6\fs180\c&H000000&\3c&H000000&\alpha&H22&\pos(960,765)}The Dream Begins
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.03,0:02:32.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.94,0:02:34.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your school's ginormous!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.49,0:02:35.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.17,0:02:38.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry I couldn't\Nshow you around first,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.25,0:02:40.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but the lunch break's almost over\Nand we don't want to be late.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.97,0:02:41.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nah, that's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.07,0:02:45.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm just excited to check\Nout your class. Sweet.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.37,0:02:49.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then let's head to the faculty room\Nand introduce you to my teacher.
Dialogue: 2,0:02:50.79,0:02:52.25,Staff Room,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.2\pos(975,699)\fax-0.02}S{*\fax-0.01}t{*\fax0}a{*\fax0.01}f{*\fax0.02}f {*\fax0.03}R{*\fax0.04}o{*\fax0.05}o{\fax0.06}m
Dialogue: 1,0:02:50.79,0:02:52.25,Staff Room,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.2\c&H788D7D&\pos(972.75,696.75)\fax-0.02}S{*\fax-0.01}t{*\fax0}a{*\fax0.01}f{*\fax0.02}f {*\fax0.03}R{*\fax0.04}o{*\fax0.05}o{\fax0.06}m
Dialogue: 1,0:02:50.79,0:02:52.25,Staff Room,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.2\c&H937998&\pos(977.25,701.25)\fax-0.02}S{*\fax-0.01}t{*\fax0}a{*\fax0.01}f{*\fax0.02}f {*\fax0.03}R{*\fax0.04}o{*\fax0.05}o{\fax0.06}m
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.31,0:02:52.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.55,0:02:54.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the one part of school I don't miss.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.07,0:02:56.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go into the faculty room.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.99,0:02:58.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.27,0:03:00.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The teachers here aren't\Nyour typical teachers.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.25,0:03:01.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.53,0:03:02.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Excuse me!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.07,0:03:03.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Me too!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.87,0:03:08.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just wanted to make\Nsure it was still alright.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.09,0:03:10.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sure, I'm fine with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.27,0:03:14.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And what's the name of the student\Nwho'll be joining us today?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.75,0:03:16.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, um, Yuki!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.53,0:03:17.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yuki Konno, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.85,0:03:19.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.19,0:03:22.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Miss Kono, you're welcome in\Nmy class any time you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.05,0:03:26.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Although, we start\NAkutagawa's Alicization today.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.15,0:03:29.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Unless you stick with it to the\Nend, you won't get the point!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.15,0:03:31.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir, thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.81,0:03:36.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See you in class.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.33,0:03:59.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's that, Miss Yuki?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.75,0:04:01.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, how'd you know my name?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.95,0:04:04.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no, she was using my last name there.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.93,0:04:05.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.95,0:04:09.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, guys, meet Yuki Kono.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.21,0:04:12.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's in the hospital right\Nnow and can't leave her room.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.23,0:04:14.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So instead, she'll be\Nattending our class like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.71,0:04:15.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nice to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.89,0:04:17.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can only hang out for?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.83,0:04:19.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a little while though.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.74,0:04:20.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nice to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.89,0:04:22.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey there, my name's Cait. Oh, hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.25,0:04:25.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, nice to meet you too.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.79,0:04:41.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please stand. Bow. Be seated.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.11,0:04:42.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right then, class.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.13,0:04:45.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please open your textbooks to page 97.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:43.57,0:04:47.91,Board,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.9\2a&HFF&\pos(37.5,37.5)\ko1}A{\ko1}k{\ko1}u{\ko1}t{\ko1}a{\ko1}g{\ko1}a{\ko1}w{\ko1}a {\ko1}R{\ko1}y{\ko1}u{\ko1}u{\ko1}n{\ko1}o{\ko1}s{\ko1}u{\ko1}k{\ko1}e
Dialogue: 1,0:04:43.78,0:04:47.91,Board,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.9\2a&HFF&\pos(246,144)\ko2.8}"{\ko2}T{\ko2.4}h{\ko2.4}e {\ko2.4}L{\ko2.4}o{\ko2.4}r{\ko2}r{\ko2}y{\ko2.4}"
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.37,0:04:49.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll be reading Alice\Nby Ryunosuke Akutagawa.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.89,0:04:52.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's see, who'll read it for us?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.95,0:04:55.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yuki Konno, would you do the honors?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.27,0:04:58.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Me?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.99,0:05:01.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.27,0:05:03.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.18,0:05:04.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.73,0:05:09.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yuki, are you up for this?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.15,0:05:13.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I might not look it,\Nbut I have read before.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.73,0:05:21.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When Ryohei was eight years old,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.15,0:05:26.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,construction on the light railway\Nbetween Odawara and Atami began.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.85,0:05:31.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Every day, he would head to the\Noutskirts of town to watch the progress.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.53,0:05:35.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It wasn't the construction of\Nit that fascinated him so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.19,0:05:39.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was the sight of the lorries\Ntransporting the soil which drew him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.09,0:05:42.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There were two laborers aboard the lorry,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.65,0:05:45.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,standing behind the\Nsoil they'd just loaded.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.87,0:05:50.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Since the lorry was headed down the\Nmountain, it didn't need anyone to push it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.51,0:05:54.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So as the chassis swung, and the\Nsleeves of the laborer's coats flapped,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.03,0:05:57.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and the narrow rails\Nbent under the strain,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.43,0:06:03.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ryohei would gaze longingly at these\Nsights and wish he could be a laborer too.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.67,0:06:08.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or at the very least, be able to\Nride on it with them, if only once.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.03,0:06:16.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I love listening to you read Yuuki.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.27,0:06:18.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, have you had a\Nchance to tour the school?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.61,0:06:20.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If not, we could show you around.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.37,0:06:21.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take it easy, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.91,0:06:23.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, wanna go to a soccer match?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.45,0:06:24.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.65,0:06:25.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're the best.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.73,0:06:28.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now that was fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.29,0:06:29.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.65,0:06:32.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks for making today happen. Asuna.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.61,0:06:34.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Really, I had a blast.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.03,0:06:36.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm never.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.27,0:06:38.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,gonna forget today. Ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.09,0:06:43.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, of course you won't.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.93,0:06:46.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The teacher said you could come back again
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.85,0:06:47.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,if you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.76,0:06:49.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, modern Japanese is\Nthird period tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.81,0:06:50.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.03,0:06:51.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,want to miss that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.94,0:06:53.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah. Okay, what's next?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.47,0:06:56.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is there anything else\Nyou want to do or see?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.09,0:06:57.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, um,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.33,0:07:00.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess there is one?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.17,0:07:02.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,place I'd like to go. Where?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.79,0:07:10.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's so pretty here, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.41,0:07:12.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just look at that sky!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.43,0:07:13.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.07,0:07:15.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.13,0:07:17.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are your folks cool with\Nyou staying out so late?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.53,0:07:19.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've been hauling me around all day!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.53,0:07:21.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you worry about it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.31,0:07:22.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I send them a text!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.25,0:07:23.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And it's fine! Well!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.55,0:07:24.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where do you want to go next?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.99,0:07:25.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yuki!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.90,0:07:26.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go left!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.33,0:07:46.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, are we in Tsukimidai yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.21,0:07:48.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.12,0:07:49.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Next corner, there's a white house.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.97,0:07:51.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can you stop there?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.07,0:08:02.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yuki, this is your house, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.87,0:08:03.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.11,0:08:07.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I never thought I'd get\Nthe chance to see it again.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.33,0:08:10.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks for bringing me out here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.55,0:08:11.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And for everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.77,0:08:14.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you want to go inside?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.59,0:08:15.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nah, this was enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.05,0:08:20.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, let's head back\Nbefore your folks get worried.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.29,0:08:21.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, it's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.51,0:08:23.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can stay a little longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.55,0:08:29.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Me and my family, we only got to\Nlive here a little over a year.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.59,0:08:34.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And the weird thing is, I can\Nremember every day so clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.79,0:08:38.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My sister and me used to play in\Nthe yard, running around and around.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.65,0:08:42.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We had barbecues, and we even built\Nthese bookshelves with our dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.03,0:08:44.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good times.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.01,0:08:45.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lucky you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.15,0:08:47.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.06,0:08:49.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're gonna tear it all down, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.69,0:08:50.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Really? Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.23,0:08:55.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My aunt wants to either put a\Nconvenience store here, or maybe sell it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.19,0:08:56.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.59,0:08:59.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's why I wanted to come here,\Nso I could see it one more time.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.05,0:09:02.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I know how you can save it. How?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.77,0:09:04.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're 15 now, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.01,0:09:08.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When you turn 16, find someone\Nyou love and marry him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.73,0:09:10.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That way you'll have\Nsomeone around who will
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.55,0:09:13.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,keep this house from ever being torn down.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.39,0:09:16.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You got the craziest ideas.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.33,0:09:20.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't think there's anyone\NI want to marry, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.97,0:09:21.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.93,0:09:23.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But you and June make a cute couple.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.83,0:09:24.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,God, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.11,0:09:26.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That guy's so immature.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.73,0:09:28.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's see.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.93,0:09:30.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who should I marry?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.77,0:09:32.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I know. You.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.97,0:09:36.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The only thing is, if you marry\Nme, you'll have to be the wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.57,0:09:40.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, the other way around, my name'd\Nbe Yuki Yuki, and that'd be weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.19,0:09:45.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't imagine what my mom\Nwould say. I know. I'm kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.41,0:09:48.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Besides, you already got someone lined up.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.27,0:09:51.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.97,0:09:53.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Still, you should be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.85,0:09:56.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I get the feeling he's not\Nliving in the real world either.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.05,0:09:58.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not like me, but, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.81,0:10:02.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't thank you enough, Asuna.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.37,0:10:05.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just to stay in my old house again?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.23,0:10:07.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't know how happy that makes me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.55,0:10:13.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Back when we lived here, I remember\Nwe'd go to church to pray and stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.47,0:10:16.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And Mom used to always say\Nthis to me and my sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.55,0:10:19.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,God would never put us through all this
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.55,0:10:22.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,suffering if He didn't\Nthink we could bear it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.37,0:10:26.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It didn't make me feel any better, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.29,0:10:28.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Instead of quoting the Bible,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.91,0:10:33.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,what I really wanted was for Mom to\Ntalk to us like, well, like a mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.71,0:10:38.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But you know, after seeing her old\Nhouse again, I think I get it now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.63,0:10:41.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The words didn't matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.31,0:10:43.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was the feeling behind those words.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.65,0:10:47.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She was praying for me so I\Nwouldn't feel sorry for myself,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.97,0:10:52.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so I could be strong to the\Nend, and now I finally get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.73,0:10:55.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.15,0:10:57.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.15,0:10:59.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I haven't understood my mom, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.79,0:11:03.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't hear what she's\Nreally trying to tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.33,0:11:05.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She can't seem to hear me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.51,0:11:09.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Remember what you told me?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.33,0:11:12.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That sometimes you have to\Nfight to get your point across?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.99,0:11:15.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How can I get to be strong? Like you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.15,0:11:17.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Me?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.06,0:11:19.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not strong. No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.35,0:11:21.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, yes, you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.79,0:11:22.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're not like me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.95,0:11:26.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When you stand up to someone, you don't\Nflinch or let them intimidate you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.87,0:11:28.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nothing seems to scare you at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.91,0:11:30.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's like second nature for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.13,0:11:33.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.89,0:11:37.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When I was living in the real\Nworld, or you know what I mean,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.35,0:11:39.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,most of the time I was faking it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.05,0:11:42.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's like I thought I had\Nto act cheerful because I
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.05,0:11:46.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,didn't want to make my mom\Nand dad feel sad for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.35,0:11:47.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yuki.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.99,0:11:50.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You want to know what I think in the end?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.53,0:11:52.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So what if I'm just acting?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.95,0:11:54.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I get to spend more time smiling,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.77,0:11:57.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,even if it's fake, what's\Nthe big deal, am I right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.05,0:12:01.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, it's not like I got\Na whole lot of time left.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.59,0:12:06.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And it'd be a shame to waste whatever\NI do got by moping around all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.61,0:12:09.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So now I say exactly\Nwhat I feel to everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.57,0:12:12.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And if they got a problem\Nwith that, who cares?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.27,0:12:13.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At least they spoke my mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.19,0:12:16.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And maybe even got a\Nlittle closer to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.83,0:12:18.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.27,0:12:20.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's the reason we're here today.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.95,0:12:21.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.86,0:12:23.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why we're so close after only a few days?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.99,0:12:25.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's all because of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.93,0:12:26.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nope.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.84,0:12:27.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That wasn't because of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.57,0:12:32.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's because even after I ran away\Nfrom you, you tracked me down.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.23,0:12:38.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, how about you try talking\Nto your mom, like you did to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.31,0:12:42.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you try telling her how you feel,\Nmaybe you'll get through to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.91,0:12:45.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry. You can do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.21,0:12:48.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're way stronger than me. Honest.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.87,0:12:53.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yuki...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.17,0:12:57.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You hit me with everything you had.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.67,0:13:00.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's how I knew I could trust\Nyou with everything I had.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.47,0:13:03.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In the end, it worked out\Nfor both of us, didn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.23,0:13:05.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, it did.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.43,0:13:06.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you so much, Yuuki.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.81,0:13:27.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you try telling her how you feel,\Nmaybe you'll get through to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.45,0:13:32.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, I know you can do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.37,0:13:37.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.95,0:13:52.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're late again.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.23,0:13:53.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.47,0:13:58.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, if you're hungry, you'll have to\Nmake do with whatever's in the fridge.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.23,0:14:02.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, and don't forget, the deadline for\Nyour transfer application is due tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.75,0:14:04.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Make sure it's filled out by morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.21,0:14:06.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Actually, about that …
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.95,0:14:10.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We need to talk, Mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.11,0:14:13.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, what is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.45,0:14:15.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't really explain it here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.85,0:14:17.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay then, where shall we go?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.65,0:14:22.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The virtual world.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.21,0:14:27.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It'll only be for a little while,\Nand you're going to have to use this.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.23,0:14:30.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't be ridiculous!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.67,0:14:33.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you can't tell me what this\Nis about like a normal person,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.83,0:14:35.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't want to hear it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.13,0:14:36.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But you don't understand!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.47,0:14:38.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the only way I can explain!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.41,0:14:39.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's just five minutes!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.23,0:14:42.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mom, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.63,0:14:46.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no other way to tell you what\NI'm thinking and how I'm feeling, honest!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.41,0:14:48.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't tell you any of that here!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.05,0:14:50.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just this once!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.13,0:14:53.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mom, all I want is for\Nyou to see my world!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.13,0:15:01.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Five minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.37,0:15:05.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But, no matter what you say,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.73,0:15:09.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have no intention of allowing you\Nto attend that school again next year,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.33,0:15:10.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,understood?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.29,0:15:13.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Also, once you're done, you\Nwill fill out that application.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.19,0:15:15.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.81,0:15:17.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So how do I use that thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.71,0:15:24.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just sit back and relax.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.63,0:15:29.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Once I turn it on, it'll automatically\Nconnect you to my subaccount in the game.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.29,0:15:33.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After you're in, wait for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.85,0:15:35.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm turning it on now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.43,0:15:47.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Link, start!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.61,0:16:05.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is so bizarre.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.19,0:16:09.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seeing a strange face mimic\Nwhat I do is unsettling.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.79,0:16:12.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And this body, it's so light.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.81,0:16:13.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, that's normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.03,0:16:17.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That particular avatar's weight\Nsetting is about 90 pounds or so.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.09,0:16:20.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Feels lighter than your real body, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.13,0:16:21.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That is so rude.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.79,0:16:24.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I do not appreciate what you're implying.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.63,0:16:25.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.97,0:16:28.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your face here looks\Njust like your real one.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.39,0:16:29.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.47,0:16:31.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Actually, I take it back.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.99,0:16:34.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your real face is puffier than this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.31,0:16:35.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, now who's being rude?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.07,0:16:38.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I look the same here as I do there.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.95,0:16:43.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I'm here. Now what?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.25,0:16:45.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't have much time left.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.07,0:16:46.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Follow me, Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.17,0:17:18.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You see?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.19,0:17:19.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It looks just like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.37,0:17:21.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have no idea what you mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.97,0:17:24.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All I see is some old cedar gro -
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.09,0:17:27.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Doesn't it bring back memories?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.13,0:17:30.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of the house that grandma and grandpa had?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.11,0:17:37.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I really loved their place in Miyagi.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.79,0:17:39.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was magical.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.27,0:18:08.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Remember that Obon holiday when I was 12?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.75,0:18:12.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You, Dad, and Koichiro went to\Nthe Yuki family Kampan in Kyoto,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.81,0:18:14.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and I went to Miyagi by myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.11,0:18:16.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.27,0:18:20.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When I got there, I apologized to\Nthem that you couldn't be with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.19,0:18:24.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I felt bad you couldn't\Nvisit our ancestors' graves.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.55,0:18:29.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wanted to, but that year, the Yukis\Nwere having an important memorial service.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.73,0:18:32.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, Mom, I'm not blaming you or anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.29,0:18:35.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In fact, you know what Grandpa said?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.27,0:18:40.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He said not to fuss because he\Nand Grandma were so proud of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.69,0:18:41.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.05,0:18:46.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You left this village,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.49,0:18:49.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,went to university, became a\Nscholar and got your work published.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.71,0:18:53.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It made him so happy to see you make\Na name for yourself in the world!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.25,0:18:58.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And then he told me\Nsomething I'll never forget.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.13,0:19:01.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That someday you might get tired from all
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.69,0:19:04.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the hard work you do and\Nneed a break from it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.23,0:19:05.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And if that day ever came,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.11,0:19:09.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,he said he wanted to make sure the house\Nand the mountain were always there.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.55,0:19:11.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That he'd guard them.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.31,0:19:13.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To give you a place to come home to.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.61,0:19:14.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,if you needed it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.51,0:19:23.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't understand it then!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.35,0:19:25.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But now, after everything\Nthat's happened to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.07,0:19:27.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think I finally do.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.59,0:19:32.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Life isn't just about doing\Nthe things that make you happy?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.19,0:19:34.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's also about finding a way to live.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.49,0:19:36.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where the happiness of\Neveryone around you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.83,0:19:37.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,fulfills you too.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.61,0:19:41.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Somehow,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.52,0:19:45.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to figure out how to live a life\Nthat makes everyone around me happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.07,0:19:48.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want a life that lets\Nme be there for the people
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.69,0:19:51.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I care about when they\Nneed someone to lean on.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.91,0:19:52.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's all I want.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.15,0:19:56.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mother, I'll study and work hard,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.41,0:19:59.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I want to keep going\Nto the school that I love.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.67,0:20:25.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.81,0:20:26.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.21,0:20:28.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not really crying.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.57,0:20:34.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mom, you can't hide it when\Nyou're sad in this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.81,0:20:37.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When you cry, you cry,\Njust like in real life.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.93,0:20:41.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Such an annoying world.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.11,0:21:26.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Asuna, are you determined to live the\Nkind of selfless life you spoke of?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.47,0:21:29.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.38,0:21:33.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If that is what you want, you'll have to\Nbe strong enough to carry that burden.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.97,0:21:36.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So make sure you go to college.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.89,0:21:42.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And for that, you'll have to get better\Ngrades this trimester and next year.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.61,0:21:45.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.52,0:21:46.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then I can stay?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.27,0:21:48.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's up to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.69,0:21:50.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll have to prove yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.01,0:21:54.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do your best.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.19,0:22:02.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Mom. I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.63,0:22:05.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Yuki.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.77,0:22:13.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here I go.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.15,0:22:14.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.06,0:22:21.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,for
